{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1343","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1343/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1343/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1343/events","html_url":"https://github.com/libgeos/geos/issues/1343","id":3731150309,"node_id":"I_kwDOACh1KM7eZNXl","number":1343,"title":"Wrong result of unary_union: islands in polygons being unioned get \"lost\"","user":{"login":"theroggy","id":1565789,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjU3ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1565789?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theroggy","html_url":"https://github.com/theroggy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theroggy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theroggy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theroggy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theroggy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theroggy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theroggy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theroggy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theroggy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theroggy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1961427520,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTYxNDI3NTIw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"d32304","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-12-15T16:13:55Z","updated_at":"2025-12-15T19:12:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When union-ing two polygon that are both ~donut shaped, the result doesn't have a hole in it anymore.\n\nOriginally reported here: https://github.com/shapely/shapely/issues/1633\n\nVisual (**left**: green + blue: overlapping donut-like shapes / **right**: result of union):\n\n<img width=\"569\" height=\"417\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/888f8377-4b19-43b1-a97c-eb8b77f1c5d4\" />\n\nScript to reproduce:\n``` python\nimport shapely\nimport shapely.wkt\nfrom shapely import plotting\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n\n# TODO shapely bug\npoly1 = shapely.wkt.loads(\n    \"POLYGON ((-70.1162076595306 -1.534802639761859, -69.11618088109869 0.1972327069961337, -58.117783208841075 -6.152921874253107, -82.91750004113058 -49.107291593330054, -92.53033522436974 -36.35721051634815, -71.84825846863409 -0.5348026424198639, -70.1162076595306 -1.534802639761859), (-70.1162076595306 -1.534802639761859, -90.1362204660169 -36.210482111666536, -83.13912274760473 -45.49115337178261, -60.849818553267646 -6.88494590501217, -70.1162076595306 -1.534802639761859))\")\npoly2 = shapely.wkt.loads(\n    \"POLYGON ((-54.71170009216383 -7.253412859063702, -80.4528216636855 -51.8383434227556, -82.83439152620278 -50.463343426410354, -85.03022855188276 -52.1188795198414, -95.62396528443203 -38.067769761534805, -93.42812825875205 -36.41223366810376, -95.80969812126934 -35.037233671758514, -73.50445135763194 3.59658713514124, -71.12288149511465 2.2215871387959965, -69.76459062209818 4.612726177890158, -69.7335565179279 4.595097198664126, -71.09184739094437 2.2039581595699644, -69.71681057060047 4.585506761362204, -55.718233134337225 -3.4968642609262157, -57.09326995468111 -5.878412862718456, -54.71170009216383 -7.253412859063702), (-60.84981855326765 -6.884945905012167, -70.1162076595306 -1.5348026397618595, -90.1362204660169 -36.210482111666536, -83.13912274760473 -45.4911533717826, -60.84981855326765 -6.884945905012167))\")\nprint(f\"{poly1.is_valid=}\")\nprint(f\"{poly2.is_valid=}\")\n\nu = shapely.unary_union([poly1, poly2])\n\nif u.area <= (poly1.area + poly2.area) + (eps := 1):\n    print(f\"Unary union OK: area ({u.area}) <= {(poly1.area + poly2.area)=}\")\nelse:\n    print(f\"Unary union not OK: area ({u.area}) > {(poly1.area + poly2.area)=}\")\n\nunion = poly1.union(poly2)\nif union.area <= (poly1.area + poly2.area) + (eps := 1):\n    print(f\"Union OK: area ({union.area}) <= {(poly1.area + poly2.area)=}\")\nelse:\n    print(f\"Union not OK: area ({union.area}) > {(poly1.area + poly2.area)=}\")\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(ncols=2, sharey=True)\n\nplotting.plot_polygon(ax=ax[0], polygon=poly1, color=\"blue\", alpha=0.5)\nplotting.plot_polygon(ax=ax[0], polygon=poly2, color=\"green\", alpha=0.5)\nplotting.plot_polygon(ax=ax[1], polygon=u, color=\"red\", alpha=0.5)\nplt.show()\n```\n\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1343/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1343/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}